{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/TN_Logo_Small_Steam_Description_01.png?t=1745056403\" />In this nose-talgic journey, you play as <strong>Sniffer</strong>, a runny nose with snotty legs and toes. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One unfortunate day, you are stolen from your beloved human and discarded into the smelly sewers below, where every breath counts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help <strong>Sniffer</strong> get <strong>back to the surface</strong> and reunite with his human as you uncover more about this <strong>delightfully scent-sational world</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/NNSD_Banner_Inhale_03b.png?t=1745056403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/NNSD_Steam_GIF_Breath_02.gif?t=1745056403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of <strong>breathing </strong>by overcoming challenges one<strong> inhale and exhale</strong> at a time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Perfect</strong> your <strong>sneezes</strong> to reach <strong>new heights</strong>, and never miss a chance to interact with objects by inhaling near them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/NNSD_Banner_Abilities_04b.png?t=1745056403\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/NNSD_Steam_GIF_Abilities_01.gif?t=1745056403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock a plethora of nose related abilities as you learn to become one with your nosey <strong>senses.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come up with creative new ways to overcome challenges and solve <strong>puzzles</strong> using these <strong>snotty abilities</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/NNSD_Banner_Quirky_03b.png?t=1745056403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll be exploring a<strong> quirky world</strong> through Sniffer\u2019s nostrils and meeting its equally<strong> quirky characters</strong>, each with their own stories and dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a hidden metropolis teeming with all kinds of scents and inhabited by the most curious of critters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, all is not well. An unknown troublemaker has been stirring up chaos, and now your new subterranean friends need your help to restore their home to its former glory!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A light-hearted, comedic and wholesome story with a <strong>funky soundtrack</strong> to accompany it. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>\u201cEvery sneeze echoes a tale. Bless you!\u201d</strong></i><strong>  <br>~ Sniffer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/Characters_Profile_Pictures_Description_01.png?t=1745056403\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3135980?t=1745056403","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745056403","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/73e24499ee123fe72966f76f1d9025388444d19c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745056403","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/73e24499ee123fe72966f76f1d9025388444d19c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745056403","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/TN_Logo_Small_Steam_Description_01.png?t=1745056403\" />In this nose-talgic journey, you play as <strong>Sniffer</strong>, a runny nose with snotty legs and toes. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One unfortunate day, you are stolen from your beloved human and discarded into the smelly sewers below, where every breath counts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help <strong>Sniffer</strong> get <strong>back to the surface</strong> and reunite with his human as you uncover more about this <strong>delightfully scent-sational world</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/NNSD_Banner_Inhale_03b.png?t=1745056403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/NNSD_Steam_GIF_Breath_02.gif?t=1745056403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of <strong>breathing </strong>by overcoming challenges one<strong> inhale and exhale</strong> at a time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Perfect</strong> your <strong>sneezes</strong> to reach <strong>new heights</strong>, and never miss a chance to interact with objects by inhaling near them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135980/extras/NNSD_Banner_Abilities_04b.png?t=1745056403\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragr